{"id": 8469876015302, "title": "Momcozy Air 1 Ultra-slim Breast Pump", "body_html": "<div></div>\n<p><strong>SLEEK, LOW-PROFILE WEAR FOR REAL LIFE</strong><br>With an ultra-slim 61mm/2.4-inch body, Air 1 sits more naturally under clothing for a polished, less bulky look. It’s designed for moms who want pumping to feel more discreet and more wearable during workdays, commuting, travel, and social outings.</p>\n<p><strong>WIRELESS CHARGING CASE, READY TO GO</strong><br>The wireless charging case supports up to 15 pumping sessions, about 30 minutes each, helping keep Air 1 ready through busy days and everyday routines. Less time stopping to recharge, more continuity for moms who need pumping to fit into life—not interrupt it.</p>\n<p><strong>TOP-VIEW VISIBILITY FOR FASTER ALIGNMENT</strong><br>The transparent top-view design helps you align faster, while clear markings let you see milk output at a glance. When you’re pumping away from home or in the middle of a busy day, that extra visibility brings more confidence and fewer repeated adjustments.<br></p>\n<p><strong>SMARTER PUMPING, STRONGER CONTROL</strong><br>Air 1 goes beyond basic app control with sensor-enabled features like auto mode switching, milk tracking, and full-collector alerts. You stay more informed throughout each session—without constantly checking, guessing, or interrupting your flow.<br></p>\n<p><strong>GENEROUS 6oz CAPACITY IN A SLIM PROFILE</strong><br>The 6oz collector gives you more room without adding bulk. Air 1 is built to balance low-profile wear with real-life pumping needs, making it a strong fit for daily use, longer outings, and other outside-home sessions.</p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Breast Pump", "created_at": "2025-03-02T22:11:54-05:00", "handle": "momcozy-air-1-ultra-slim-breast-pump", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:54:48-04:00", "published_at": "2025-03-02T22:29:58-05:00", "template_suffix": "air1-new-pdp2606", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "air 1, Top100_Sales, 